#: scenario8:scenario8_D1B494DA_31AD_409F_91EE_C3F61A2683A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22a014d50f89b4fddfcf89c6079600e5b955a9ac96b66b03acda17d21f5f1c69
#. default-sha256: 6b7cd93bc62782b9c2317cf2775f3ba92a433b9ff5d88633d8b6da6935e8e3d5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D1B494DA_31AD_409F_91EE_C3F61A2683A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫On days when it was nice out,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I would take walks around the house’s grounds,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫화창한 날엔 친가 정원을 산책하다가――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A9BABB81_749F_4964_9AD1_E69F58DEE34D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01fcce5010affe92c996bfc1f5d0ace03c4fd05609eb267d3aa9478f1699f822
#. default-sha256: ec4246da983da86aabfd3b1169d7b6f3073320e01940aea212ba62ad9a06df75
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A9BABB81_749F_4964_9AD1_E69F58DEE34D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫sometimes napping beneath a tree."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫나무 그늘에서 낮잠을 잤지……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4BED022D_815C_4FFF_B1B1_70419C5FC109
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73174fc26dd67cf514cfb4cd8395bce1a1836420b9c3ba09fd64782185bb1070
#. default-sha256: aa8a4d5e2359e9e88cd54c8f8c3b8027afdb11999e4cec02b63f8b68b17acabc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4BED022D_815C_4FFF_B1B1_70419C5FC109"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫whereas mine is flat and dull."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫내 머리카락하곤 다르게 보였어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E3166BAA_BA5A_4E7B_9D32_689B25DD9633
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 769a9bcd520a76a6b7218536b8e32621043f7891d6a1a6a1971c4b8531c5eeb4
#. default-sha256: b69649fe39fcd6692e78da6cf5c8afb40d3f6af1a64118e9f45ffc9b5d660bb9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E3166BAA_BA5A_4E7B_9D32_689B25DD9633"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You shone like a tiny little dancing sun."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫꼭 태양 같았지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0114CDC6_DD89_463C_AF9E_DD612D17C3A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5ee217a9148dbcbf3ef762457585c25b5e119b378889791f3181bced9771125
#. default-sha256: 1f26138775db7057b3a8d82d77ab21201004983b19551d7ef4784eeb1f85151f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0114CDC6_DD89_463C_AF9E_DD612D17C3A0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫At the time, I assumed that was how life would always be."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그런 평화로운 나날이……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_026D5E20_738D_4C2B_A483_A709FFB94996
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4bd5e966d21571f249fdfe49bdf0f3213824381a8d6c4f78842a2299c80f5c6
#. default-sha256: 950638bc63761dd347b7d067e3310ece355e889381d83130e91693b96d4392b6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_026D5E20_738D_4C2B_A483_A709FFB94996"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Part of me wanted to know why nobody bothered talking to me,⟪k:1⟫and part of me was "
"relieved. ⟪k:2⟫Somewhere inside, I knew I didn’t have what it took."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫한편으로 안심하기도 했어. ⟪k:2⟫나는 자각하고 있었거든. ⟪k:3⟫내가 후계자가 될 그릇"
"이 아니란 걸……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0C1CDE28_7606_473D_B23B_F7FB5A3A1B49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b58031a6e6e7bde76a08ce6a807a7f05f4f7e05d5a9ce50908c0358c1b9a6b4d
#. default-sha256: f2f5aa48c84fbd532e6644c5744291f090045ea257d16d8ea608eaba0dbbd628
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0C1CDE28_7606_473D_B23B_F7FB5A3A1B49"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and in response, he formally disowned me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래, ⟪k:1⟫나는 즉―― 의절당했어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_70CAA6B3_33FB_4FAC_ACFC_5AAD1525E679
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26eaac6cc97a53cc96a43819ae4f4ad753cd08da6ce1fe9e0efa4f962a32cccb
#. default-sha256: 1048eda262caa587784558e7f8acbebcd96a81b2d8a22d613248eafe625b4c47
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_70CAA6B3_33FB_4FAC_ACFC_5AAD1525E679"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re not the only one who still had some growing up to do, Nellie...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wasn’t "
"quite the adult I’d thought I was either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어른이 되지 못 한 건……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫넬리, ⟪k:3⟫너 뿐만이 아니라…… 나도 똑같았지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_FA7D6747_967F_4BD1_8158_BB4648567C75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5595e874869419c9c56b3d2bdd207395ac38265d22143d8b6f18435b3cd94d8d
#. default-sha256: 6784d709f007f19a86f7af06b162e863e6b399f118f05767511e30e177edf8a3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FA7D6747_967F_4BD1_8158_BB4648567C75"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Fortunately—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫if you want to call it fortune—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I was given enough "
"money to live on for a decent length of time, as well as a place to stay."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫의절 선언을 듣긴 했어도, ⟪k:3⟫불행 중의 다행인지 ⟪k:4⟫나한텐 얼마간 먹고 살 자금이 "
"주어졌어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2ACB9DF5_AC71_4539_99AC_FB660B3619B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 970c9b4cb3556560040acbe32db933b576c79fb988d346a8329577c823d77ea3
#. default-sha256: 31c39f34d61a914febd1b3ee8d10176c1d3525df402bca15ee6083d47fbbbcfd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2ACB9DF5_AC71_4539_99AC_FB660B3619B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫내가 살 곳도…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫친가에서 한참 떨어진 곳에 ⟪k:4⟫집 한 채를 받은 거야."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫내가 살 곳도…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫친가에서 한참 떨어진 곳에 ⟪k:4⟫집 한 채를 받은 거야."

#: scenario8:scenario8_82CD33D1_0CF8_440F_B31F_CA3D47AD9315
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38fd11217764d288dda42fb0621ef3e536b3506868aca73e14bbb2d72fefc48d
#. default-sha256: aabc0d6b1685239de425ca77c3db220ea7d880d72634fc41ce7cb9f0c2aa2960
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_82CD33D1_0CF8_440F_B31F_CA3D47AD9315"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...Oh?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫뭐………?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F0F66272_1A70_4843_A7E7_E74FE97787A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4dd1f2c76778f3970b91fab57a735c5939cf202697ed4388dbd5800a74026701
#. default-sha256: 1471489f5ddca79daaeaa928e06081caf2bf6a57e6d2d34c0e594daf0040c155
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F0F66272_1A70_4843_A7E7_E74FE97787A7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I don’t need composers to come and write me songs for my birthday. ⟪k:2⟫As long as I "
"have the one thing that matters most to me, I can do without anything else."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫생일에 ⟪k:2⟫음악가가 곡을 선물하지 않아도―― 가장 소중한 것만 곁에 있으면 ⟪k:3⟫만족해."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4CAD8A9E_DEF1_4D17_9955_4D40055BA4EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99dca2bf0a69b5411def051386fe8439a367dced8e16f403699d4f10e21743da
#. default-sha256: dbc6c52da14f699ba6e919aaa31417cc4fc836a649a119995f5885e9afacc62d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4CAD8A9E_DEF1_4D17_9955_4D40055BA4EB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We may not have a huge yard, but the sun shines everywhere.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Flowers can grow even "
"without a gardener tending to them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫정원이 없어도 ⟪k:1⟫태양은 매일 빛나잖아.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫정원사가 손질을 안 해도 ⟪k:4⟫꽃은 피잖아."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0781453F_274D_4AFD_AE30_1C99F1552F2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ca2a4dc85f595d1658603a97018eb25189451823cb8293e12f137af27d7be8d
#. default-sha256: f80a4e901af71b6b5ca25cc0045042217874df845a9e86ec765a8d8ac7b2fc09
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0781453F_274D_4AFD_AE30_1C99F1552F2F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What else sounds good? ⟪k:1⟫Hmm... ⟪k:2⟫I’m craving cookies!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫다른 건 뭐가 필요할까? ⟪k:1⟫엄청 단 케이크도 만들고 싶은걸!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_16735FB1_6A43_4AAC_A996_D588EFCC1B56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65b1a3c0f1490cc0bc5171e6c042022c43c843a759ae37a59c8e16673a83e5d7
#. default-sha256: f88eb281be21f746fffae638433b20eaf5bf89c2bacff138514792ba6f1ec47d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_16735FB1_6A43_4AAC_A996_D588EFCC1B56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That’s the first smile I’ve seen since we got here."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫오라버니, ⟪k:2⟫이제야 웃었네."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7A6088F2_2857_4496_9125_BCEA0EA68271
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64aa12f56b759020bd3b28373a646c8c719304e79fb2e85d7d00988e810f31f8
#. default-sha256: c8e6da3f2bcbc4fecfdad60e3f584be4ce724c08958b7af6e673edc507888e12
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7A6088F2_2857_4496_9125_BCEA0EA68271"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Who cares that we’re not rich anymore?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫We’ll figure things out in no time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫평민이 되면 뭐 어때.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫넬리랑 오라버니라면 ⟪k:4⟫금세 다양한 걸 익혀서――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_65533E70_3D7C_4305_92E2_C898165BAD9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 199e2f6fbbec5bfb695937bc1b495a471e2a664f5b9ed093060d022fdbf1b811
#. default-sha256: d8cea73d84ed9def7ddf7a8cfb4e9c298efce9656e1bf6d0738991d74f929ea1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_65533E70_3D7C_4305_92E2_C898165BAD9F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then we’ll have even more fun than we did back there!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫전보다 더 즐거운 생활이 가능해질 거야!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_89CC1705_38AE_40B2_BCEF_1A28D235D33D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3dc6834a6d07a0b1377ba97303f5575a63fd3b6e74f7ac74b9fa736305a997d1
#. default-sha256: 5ec7c59fdb798752d5b3f39a2f6c42942de3538b5d56bc86764fee3215fe7747
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_89CC1705_38AE_40B2_BCEF_1A28D235D33D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’ve got yourself an adorable little princess!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What more could you possibly "
"need?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫넬리가 오라버니의 ⟪k:2⟫무지무지 귀여운 공주님이 될 거야!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그럼 충분하지?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8871344A_3F24_4690_8C8C_8A34F4D9E84D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a792671a565bb3c7c4cf32b96a749dbe14455200a449fdcfe3e73ef78864338c
#. default-sha256: 5a4d4a00f9f16aa72629d803ea7fc38293e9a01a8ecc23a996e934f0771166d6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8871344A_3F24_4690_8C8C_8A34F4D9E84D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Cheer up!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫자, ⟪k:2⟫그러니까 오라버니. ⟪k:3⟫기운 내자."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3E139956_A055_4D47_B55D_3FAAA6856A23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 029c0133b5919d04c54ad3bd47280ed6daa73742d505c1575adb607c61f09c82
#. default-sha256: 5fdd07cba88be1ee4f3d2211d0da4b859318f0618f3bb90199718d333b142558
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3E139956_A055_4D47_B55D_3FAAA6856A23"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ohoho. Did you think for a second I wouldn’t?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m your princess, dearest Mell!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……흐흐흥, ⟪k:2⟫넬리가 오라버니 곁에 있는 건 당연한 건데?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫넬리는 ⟪k:5⟫오라버니"
"의 공주님이잖아!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3ED2A53C_3AFD_4A2F_89B6_974A96B940D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3336d1fc1c34f50de4c4f22a8e2bb3d8e577dfff40b90c6b2fc462d43723f8c
#. default-sha256: f47d4d75ece656e37861e6f0735af673977b1e44007716750f0128e379ec0d22
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3ED2A53C_3AFD_4A2F_89B6_974A96B940D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And princesses belong with their princes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫공주님은 ⟪k:2⟫왕자님 곁에 있어야지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_76276090_6E2F_4AF5_81BB_20FBB6F318B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 930bae15799157bbaef03aa3d7c27f355a5cd34c74a842d80a618ae7707baf0e
#. default-sha256: d74e7c866b96df2144e38af9a746e0ed453936af28cccae284153d9c7a84d1a5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_76276090_6E2F_4AF5_81BB_20FBB6F318B9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but Nellie calling me her prince gave me the illusion of being worth something."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫넬리가 그렇게 말해 주니 ⟪k:1⟫나한테 가치가 있단 착각이 들었어."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3F2F6511_96BF_4686_99A5_2288F805FB64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c3e009ec5aae8595d57ee07a26fda59000ba42d48a3491a7ff12d2000b32555
#. default-sha256: 0883e9f49737ee63d5c9dd6f290aeff4eca03eef5dd8d058a7823d956511c68f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3F2F6511_96BF_4686_99A5_2288F805FB64"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It made me feel like I could keep on being that richly blessed young man, even this far away "
"from home."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫예전처럼 ⟪k:1⟫뭐든 가진 나로 지낼 수…… 있을 것 같았지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CC8CE97C_57A4_4844_94E7_B1E25F7B1C5E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9e8c39505aae79ccbe6dc2972a34d4da881449b6afece24d46a4b575ea4dada
#. default-sha256: 8727659b3f042866a403abf828e96c60e9922ee315c5705ade2bbaea4965b254
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CC8CE97C_57A4_4844_94E7_B1E25F7B1C5E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but to be quite honest, I couldn’t gather the motivation to do much of anything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫솔직히 말해서…… ⟪k:1⟫뭘 ⟪k:2⟫할 의욕이 안 나더라."

#: scenario8:scenario8_63C6DAC9_1B4B_48E4_B46D_DCEA67D4D6F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eadfe97ec9b43dcd7d2203ffa2df21d15019fd4a76085e3cf195e6e3548bc4f7
#. default-sha256: 80aea79b98599c2099bb43bda12277ee76beb55f089b773ba38883bbd19e1323
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_63C6DAC9_1B4B_48E4_B46D_DCEA67D4D6F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It had knocked me on my backside,⟪k:1⟫and I didn’t have the strength to get back up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫충격이 커서…… ⟪k:1⟫꼼짝도 못 한 거지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ADDC0075_5107_434C_B85B_C7D0503F1A53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dee6ccc6d907fcbfa970d631cd6058f4f47171253bfb9d6825a67f4b18f5040d
