"⟪k:0⟫나는…… ⟪k:1⟫미소 하나는 ⟪k:2⟫칭찬 많이 듣거든.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫푸근하고 호감 가게 ⟪k:5⟫웃는다나……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EF293F8E_BEB5_4899_98D4_D5713E7955BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
