msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagined how much sweeter it would sound without a door obstructing it. ⟪k:1⟫Even knowing "
"what she looked like didn’t stop the curiosity from growing within me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫더 가까이, ⟪k:1⟫문 너머가 아니라 옆에서 그 목소리를 들으면 ⟪k:2⟫좋겠거니 싶더라. ⟪k:3⟫그 애 "
"목소리는 ⟪k:4⟫진짜 고왔거든."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B9C2E61F_F8C8_4ECA_AED8_DC19DDB44DD1
