msgid "⟪k:0⟫I tossed the arm—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Morgana’s arm—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫the man had given me into the lake."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 남자한테 받은 모르가나의 팔도――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫호수에다 던졌지……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A1979001_2187_424B_8AF1_F2A6154F5777
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 101bb6c69aa22b1e5004241a0883df0b6a82c3b421ea5281be949b00f55869d2
