msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A1979001_2187_424B_8AF1_F2A6154F5777"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I tried to convince myself it was all a dream—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫some terrible nightmare—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"but I could still feel the warmth of her skin fresh on my hands,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이건 현실이 아닌 ⟪k:1⟫악몽일 거라――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫속에다 되뇌도, ⟪k:4⟫손바닥에 남은 그 애 팔의 온"
"기가……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2BF49F46_6AF3_43F9_AB7A_750AB81CA28F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46ab8df9497aa7c2b6f3fc583356f3a2e2f2067807f45840a1d6f53676dc133b
#. default-sha256: 28ec9f4045bdb83a92a9c86e801d5befbae3ef5e791ed1bfd841d886bf16512a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2BF49F46_6AF3_43F9_AB7A_750AB81CA28F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My mind couldn’t keep up with the flood of thoughts and emotions and images. ⟪k:1⟫I wanted "
"to close my eyes, but I was too afraid I would find the bloodbath in the cottage on the back of "
"my eyelids,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫머리가 따라잡질 못 했어. ⟪k:1⟫눈을 감으면 참극이 떠오를 것 같아서 ⟪k:2⟫눈도 못 감았고――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AFBC8CCF_A298_4ED2_9E04_DE83FDE1BBCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd04f49a681ccf21ce4161a9484e4824913f98935181b94efb07e94cba7f5ed6
