msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Were... ⟪k:1⟫Were you not able to get my medicine?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Is that what you’re crying "
"about...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫넬리의…… ⟪k:1⟫약을 ⟪k:2⟫못 찾았구나……?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그래서…… ⟪k:5⟫그렇게 ⟪k:6⟫우는 거지……?"

