msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……아……, ⟪k:1⟫으……, ⟪k:2⟫응…………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0B886BDE_EEB3_4BB1_856E_0A859F5AB88A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a61400c1948c9ccc91b30a9b9fed95c3c8a3c1d65d81b50549d2f1df6fdb7dce
