"⟪k:0⟫But whenever I lay down to go to sleep,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I heard her screams. Morgana’s animalistic "
"howls."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫잠들면 꼭 들리더라.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……모르가나의 비명이 들려."

#: scenario8:scenario8_51D028D6_FAB7_4011_B45D_AA78823E0D66
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c4c6e0ef80a86f8a2568ecf5a16d9660cfdc34263e3daac02328f90ccccfdaf
