msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1FC153A0_693A_4ADF_A944_6DC8C27F7142"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At some point, though, all that money I’d been given started running low. ⟪k:1⟫If I’d "
"thought about it for two seconds, I would have seen it coming;"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫어느새 ⟪k:2⟫그렇게 많던 자금도 거의 떨어져 있었어. ⟪k:3⟫생각해 보면 당연한 거였"
"지……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ABD643F9_9E81_43AE_822E_53471C2F8D3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce5d738cb2ba7a59fd045d8adb1db535fa13d72cb3a7696240f05c4d1704b4e7
