msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_ABD643F9_9E81_43AE_822E_53471C2F8D3B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Every day that passed, I lost a little more hope.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If I couldn’t do anything and "
"Nellie died... ⟪k:3⟫I would be utterly alone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 절망감은 갈수록 커졌어. ⟪k:1⟫이러다 넬리가 진짜로 죽으면…… ⟪k:2⟫나는 혼자가 돼."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3F8F8AE1_32B0_40F0_9667_DF2819448D45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ce8b55fe877aa01fb40e41f90b4c782547779a3aca1420fa15abda29519c365
